OL,3,AState pension likely to top #13,000 a
OL,4,Ayear as UK wage growth slows to 3.9%
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe state pension is expected to top
OL,7,F#13,000 a year, reigniting the debate
OL,8,Fabout its long-term affordability and
OL,9,Fgenerational fairness.
OL,11,FThe full, flat-rate state pension is
OL,12,Fexpected to rise by #488 a year in
OL,13,FApril, based on the latest official
OL,14,Fearnings figure released on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe so-called triple lock pension
OL,17,Fpolicy guarantees that the state
OL,18,Fpension will increase by either average
OL,19,Fwage growth, inflation or 2.5% -
OL,20,Fwhichever is highest.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
